<td style="height:2px;background-color:#026631;font-size:0;line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n                </table>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td align="center" class="px" style="padding:22px 44px 22px 44px;border-top:1px solid #edf0ed;">\n                <p class="body-font" style="margin:0;font-size:11px;line-height:18px;color:#7b8388;">\n                  You are receiving this email because you subscribed to updates from David Maraga Campaign. &copy; 2026 David Maraga Campaign. Integrity, justice and service for Kenya. All rights reserved.<br />\n                  <a href="#" style="color:#7b8388;text-decoration:underline;">Unsubscribe</a>\n                  &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n                  <a href="#" style="color:#7b8388;text-decoration:underline;">Update preferences</a>\n                  &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n                  <a href="#" style="color:#7b8388;text-decoration:underline;">View in browser</a>\n                </p>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n\n        </table>\n        <!-- /MAIN CARD -->\n\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n    </table>\n  </center>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n	{"{\\"type\\": \\"greeting\\", \\"title\\": \\"You've joined something bigger than a campaign\\", \\"eyebrow\\": \\"We are now on SMS\\", \\"greeting\\": \\"Hello {{first_name}},\\"}","{\\"body\\": \\"<p><span style=\\\\\\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);\\\\\\">You didn't just add your name to a list. You joined </span><a href=\\\\\\"https://davidmaraga.info/\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\"background-color:transparent;color:hsl(240,75%,60%);\\\\\\">a movement</span></a><span style=\\\\\\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);\\\\\\"> by Kenyans and for Kenyans determined to build a prosperous country governed by the rule of law, integrity and meritocracy. A country where leaders and government dutifully respect the rights and dignity of every citizen regardless of where they come from.</span></p><p><span style=\\\\\\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);\\\\\\">That’s what </span><a href=\\\\\\"https://davidmaraga.info/blog/answering-the-call-to-lead-david-maraga-for-president\\\\\\"><span style=\\\\\\"background-color:transparent;color:hsl(240,75%,60%);\\\\\\">Maraga’27 </span></a><span style=\\\\\\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);\\\\\\">stands for.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\\\\\\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);\\\\\\">Our 2027 campaign is built on the philosophy of Constitutionalism (Ukatiba). Not a slogan but a governing standard. We are committed to leadership with integrity, accountable management of public resources and prosperity of all Kenyans.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\\\\\\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);\\\\\\">Welcome to the movement to restore, reset and rebuild Kenya.</span></p><p><span style=\\\\\\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);\\\\\\">Expect updates, rally announcements, policy highlights, and honest discussions on how we can move forward together on our&nbsp; platforms.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\\\\\\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(0,0,0);\\\\\\">Be the first to know! Follow the steps to receive the latest SMS updates on the campaign.&nbsp;</span></p><p><img class=\\\\\\"image_resized\\\\\\" style=\\\\\\"aspect-ratio:1080/1350;width:98.71%;\\\\\\" src=\\\\\\"/uploads/a054f831-b33c-4188-ad62-74cc33e8a188.jpeg\\\\\\" width=\\\\\\"1080\\\\\\" height=\\\\\\"1350\\\\\\"></p>\\", \\"type\\": \\"text\\"}","{\\"url\\": \\"https://donations.davidmaraga.com/\\", \\"type\\": \\"cta\\", \\"label\\": \\"I Would Like to Donate\\", \\"subtext\\": \\"Every contribution powers grassroots organizing across Kenya.\\", \\"text_color\\": \\"#f7f7f7\\", \\"button_color\\": \\"#e12323\\"}","{\\"name\\": \\"David Maraga \\", \\"type\\": \\"signature\\", \\"tagline\\": \\"Katiba Ndio Tiba\\", \\"salutation\\": \\"With gratitude,\\"}"}
4	Kenya Cannot Wait. Be at Ufungamano This Tuesday.	Maraga's State of the Nation — Tuesday, June 16 at Ufungamano House.	<!doctype html>\n<html lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:v="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office">\n<head>\n  <meta charset="utf-8" />\n  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />\n  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />\n  <meta name="color-scheme" content="light only" />\n  <meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light only" />\n  <title>David Maraga Campaign — Newsletter</title>\n  <!--[if mso]><noscript><xml><o:OfficeDocumentSettings><o:PixelsPerInch>96</o:PixelsPerInch></o:OfficeDocumentSettings></xml></noscript><![endif]-->\n  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Lato:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;0,900;1,400&family=Oswald:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,500;1,500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />\n  <link href="https://fonts.cdnfonts.com/css/calfine" rel="stylesheet" />\n  <style>\n    @font-face{font-family:"Calfine";src:url("https://fonts.cdnfonts.com/s/87534/Calfine.woff") format("woff");font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;}\n    body,table,td,a{-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%;}\n    table,td{mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;}\n    img{-ms-interpolation-mode:bicubic;border:0;height:auto;line-height:100%;outline:none;text-decoration:none;}\n    body{margin:0;padding:0;width:100%!important;height:100%!important;}\n    a{text-decoration:none;}\n    .head-font{font-family:"Oswald","Arial Narrow",Arial,sans-serif;}\n    .body-font{font-family:"Lato",Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;}\n    .serif-font{font-family:"Playfair Display",Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;}\n    .calfine-font{font-family:"Calfine","Playfair Display",Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;}\n    @media screen and (max-width:620px){\n      .container{width:100%!important;}\n      .px{padding-left:22px!important;padding-right:22px!important;}\n      .title{font-size:28px!important;line-height:34px!important;}\n      .stack{display:block!important;width:100%!important;}\n      .footer-col{display:block!important;width:100%!important;text-align:center!important;}\n      .footer-contact{padding-top:18px!important;}\n      .footer-social table{margin:0 auto!important;}\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body class="body-font" style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#eef2ee;background:radial-gradient(circle at top,rgba(208,178,22,0.1),transparent 30%),linear-gradient(180deg,#ffffff 0%,#f1f6f1 100%);">\n\n  <div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;color:#f1f6f1;opacity:0;">Maraga's State of the Nation — Tuesday, June 16 at Ufungamano House.</div>\n\n  <center style="width:100%;background-color:#eef2ee;">\n    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">\n      <tr>\n        <td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px">\n\n          <!-- MAIN CARD -->\n          <table role="presentation" class="container" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"\n            style="width:600px;max-width:600px;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(2,102,49,0.16);">\n\n            <!-- MASTHEAD -->\n            <tr>\n              <td align="center" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:28px 24px 22px 24px">\n                <img src="https://davidmaraga.info/images/logo.png" alt="Maraga '27" width="210"\n                  style="display:block;width:210px;max-width:60%;height:auto;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;" />\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n\n            <!-- GOLD ACCENT BAR -->\n            <tr>\n              <td style="height:4px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#ceb04e 0%,#026631 50%,#d61f26 100%);font-size:0;line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td>\n            </tr>\n\n            <!-- DYNAMIC SECTIONS -->\n            <tr>\n  <td class="px" style="padding:34px 44px 0 44px">\n    <p class="serif-font" style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-style:italic;font-size:17px;color:#ceb04e;">This week on the trail</p>\n    <h1 class="head-font title" style="margin:0;font-size:34px;line-height:40px;letter-spacing:0.5px;font-weight:700;color:#222222;">Building a Kenya Rooted in Integrity &amp; Justice</h1>\n    <p class="body-font" style="margin:22px 0 0 0;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#333333;">Hello {{first_name}},</p>\n  </td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n  <td class="px body-font" style="padding:14px 44px 0 44px;font-size:18px;line-height:31px;color:#444444;">\n    <p style="margin:0;">Thank you for standing with the movement. Write your main message here. Use {{first_name}} anywhere to greet each volunteer personally.</p>\n  </td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n  <td class="px" style="padding:24px 44px 0 44px">\n    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"\n      style="background-color:#f1f6f1;border-radius:14px;border-left:4px solid #ceb04e;">\n      <tr>\n        <td style="padding:15px 18px">\n          <p class="head-font" style="margin:0 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#026631;font-weight:600;">Highlights this week</p>\n          <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">\n            <tr>\n  <td valign="top" width="20" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#d61f26;line-height:22px;">&#10003;</td>\n  <td class="body-font" style="font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#444444;padding-bottom:9px;">Add your first highlight here</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n  <td valign="top" width="20" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#d61f26;line-height:22px;">&#10003;</td>\n  <td class="body-font" style="font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#444444;padding-bottom:9px;">Add another highlight</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n  <td valign="top" width="20" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#d61f26;line-height:22px;">&#10003;</td>\n  <td class="body-font" style="font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#444444;padding-bottom:9px;">And one more</td>\n</tr>\n\n          </table>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n    </table>\n  </td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n  <td class="px" align="center" style="padding:30px 44px 6px 44px">\n    <a href="https://donations.davidmaraga.com/" target="_blank" class="head-font"\n      style="display:inline-block;background-color:#ceb04e;color:#026631;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;padding:16px 38px;border-radius:999px;">\n      I Would Like to Donate\n    </a>\n    <p class="body-font" style="margin:14px 0 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#888888;">Every contribution powers grassroots organizing across Kenya.</p>\n  </td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n  <td class="px" style="padding:24px 44px 0 44px">\n    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"\n      style="border-top:1px solid #ececec">\n      <tr><td style="height:22px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class="body-font" style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#444444;">\n          With gratitude,<br />\n          <span class="serif-font" style="font-size:22px;font-style:italic;color:#026631;line-height:28px;">The Maraga 2027 Team</span><br />\n          <span class="head-font" style="font-size:20px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#ceb04e;line-height:26px;">Integrity · Justice · Service</span>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n    </table>\n  </td>\n</tr>\n\n\n            \n            <tr>\n              <td class="px" style="padding:24px 44px 0 44px">\n                <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">\n                  <tr>\n                    <td class="footer-col footer-social" valign="middle" align="left" style="width:44%">\n                      <p class="head-font" style="margin:0 0 12px 0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#026631;font-weight:700;">Connect with us</p>\n                      <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">\n  <tr>\n    <td align="center" style="padding:0 5px">\n  <a href="https://x.com/dkmaraga" target="_blank" aria-label="X"\n    style="display:inline-block;width:32px;height:32px;background-color:#026631;border-radius:50%;text-align:center;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;line-height:32px;">\n    <img src="https://davidmaraga.info/images/social/x.png" width="14" height="14" alt="X" style="display:inline-block;width:14px;height:14px;margin-top:9px;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:top;" />\n  </a>\n</td>\n\n<td align="center" style="padding:0 5px">\n  <a href="https://www.instagram.com/maraga2027" target="_blank" aria-label="Instagram"\n    style="display:inline-block;width:32px;height:32px;background-color:#026631;border-radius:50%;text-align:center;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;line-height:32px;">\n    <img src="https://davidmaraga.info/images/social/instagram.png" width="14" height="14" alt="Instagram" style="display:inline-block;width:14px;height:14px;margin-top:9px;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:top;" />\n  </a>\n</td>\n\n<td align="center" style="padding:0 5px">\n  <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@dkmaraga" target="_blank" aria-label="YouTube"\n    style="display:inline-block;width:32px;height:32px;background-color:#026631;border-radius:50%;text-align:center;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;line-height:32px;">\n    <img src="https://davidmaraga.info/images/social/youtube.png" width="15" height="15" alt="YouTube" style="display:inline-block;width:15px;height:15px;margin-top:8px;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:top;" />\n  </a>\n</td>\n\n<td align="center" style="padding:0 5px">\n  <a href="https://www.facebook.com/Maraga2027" target="_blank" aria-label="Facebook"\n   