9	Human Mosaic Season 2: CJ David Maraga	Justice David Kenani Maraga is a distinguished Kenyan jurist who served as the 14th Chief Justice and President of the Supreme Court of Kenya from 2016 to 2021. With over four decades of experience in the legal profession, he has made significant contributions to Kenya's judicial landscape, constitutionalism and the rule of law.\nCurrently serving as Co-Party Leader of the United Green Movement (UGM), Justice Maraga is seeking the presidency in Kenya's 2027 General Election as the party's presidential flag bearer.\nA respected voice in matters of leadership, integrity, constitutionalism and public service, he brings a wealth of experience and perspective to conversations on purpose, personal values and the responsibility of leadership.	Karen Amusement Home	2026-11-22 09:00:00	2026-11-22 16:30:00	t	t	2026-11-20 11:31:52	2026-11-20 11:31:52	/uploads/a318d56e-c3e1-4c57-923f-562b220259e7.jpeg
10	END YEAR COMEDY FUNDRAISING DINNER 	Join us on the 19th December, at Zen Garden in Nairobi for dinner, laughter and fundraising for the campaign. These funds will support our activities in the final make or break stretch of our campaign next year. \n\nDinner Tickets at Ksh 10,000 . Here’s how to secure your tickets or sponsor a seat for someone \n\nTickets Available on \nMpesa  Paybill No 4164137 ||  Account No 4164137\n\nFor the Diaspora\nZelle: Crucible25 | \nCash App: TheCrucibleInstitute |\n www. donations.davidmaraga.com\n\n\n\n	Zen Gardens,  Westlands 	2026-12-19 18:00:00	\N	f	t	2026-11-20 13:02:54	2026-11-20 13:11:31	/uploads/e679dbff-8e93-47fc-a505-3dc36191817e.jpg
