9	STATE OF THE NATION: THE WAY FORWARD SPEECH BY DAVID MARAGA AT UFUNGAMANO HOUSE	David K. Maraga, UGM co-party leader and Presidential flag bearer,  delivered the speech at Ufungamano House, Tuesday 16th June 2026. \n\nIn an unyielding declaration to the nation, David Maraga pledged that the Constitution will be his absolute command, promising to aggressively dismantle rogue governance, eliminate institutional fraud, and restore the foundational dignity of the Kenyan people. \n\nAsserting that the current economic environment has been turned into a hostage situation by punitive regulations and systemic corruption, Maraga vowed to rapidly revive the economy by lowering energy costs, slashing redundant business licenses, eliminating protection rackets, and strictly prioritizing local agriculture over destructive imports.	Public	/uploads/a4c9b35e-2196-4797-b782-af2f2d154817.png	t	3	2026-06-25 12:47:35	2026-06-25 15:01:29	t	video	https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KFRo5NZyJmU
