ribution is tracked in real time, with donor records and automated receipting to ensure transparency and compliance with political financing guidelines.\n\nCampaign operations are further enhanced through volunteer and agent coordination tools, enabling the recruitment, training, and deployment of thousands of personnel across the country. Team leads can monitor field progress, assign tasks, and streamline communications within the system.\n\nTo ensure timely and accountable spending, Politech comes with a secure disbursement engine. This module allows for bulk and individual payments to agents, suppliers, and service providers, complete with audit trails, payment statuses, and reconciliation tools.\n\nOn election day, the automated vote tallying dashboard becomes a crucial asset. Field agents can submit results from their polling stations, which are then aggregated and visualized in real time to give campaign leadership an accurate picture of performance as the day unfolds.\n\nAll of this is powered by real-time analytics and reporting, providing insights into supporter distribution, volunteer engagement, fundraising trends, and high-risk zones. Lastly, Politech prioritizes data protection through enterprise-grade security, offering role-based access controls, end-to-end encryption, and secure cloud infrastructure to safeguard sensitive campaign information.	2025-07-17	2025-07-17	2026-06-14 18:37:33	2026-06-14 18:37:33
